# Vercel's local project link. Holds the project and org ids for `vercel
# --prod`, is per-clone, and is not something another clone should inherit.
.vercel

# Every shape of env file, in one glob rather than a list — .env, .env.local,
# .env.production and whatever comes next. This is the important line in the
# file: the Resend key, the LiveKit secret and the Supabase service-role key
# all belong in one of these, and any of them reaching a public repository is
# a key rotation and an incident rather than a mistake to fix quietly. A glob
# cannot be defeated by somebody inventing a new suffix.
.env*

# Generated by dev/email-preview.js. Regenerate it rather than reading a
# committed copy — a stale one is a preview of the template as it used to be,
# which is the exact failure the script exists to avoid.
dev/email-preview.html
dev/.email-preview.mts

# macOS.
.DS_Store
supabase/.temp/
